# serializer (marker styles, setext headings, thematic-break variants, etc.).
# Prettier's markdown formatter normalizes those away, fighting the editor —
# so leave these files exactly as written/saved.
samples/

# The round-trip fidelity corpus. `roundTripCorpus.test.ts` asserts that opening
